{
  "primary": [
    {
      "speaker": "2506",
      "source_id": "2506-11278-0030",
      "chapter": "11278",
      "transcript": "I WILL PULL ANY MAN'S NOSE WHO SAYS SO",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "66cfa62c7e8341e8b3e169cacf4319969853371047140771547b9b66c60138b7"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "2506",
      "source_id": "2506-13150-0005",
      "chapter": "13150",
      "transcript": "THE WIND CHOPP'D ABOUT",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "98083cb72fbd9e84a0faeab51fff872b7fd43255b425c744cf9db000ac6cb2ce"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "4570",
      "source_id": "4570-14911-0013",
      "chapter": "14911",
      "transcript": "SHOULDERS CLEAN AND SLIGHTLY SLOPING",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "63104938c2f813b8588c67721690ae0654bd4df4f909ddb21e9ef9d5d3c593a8"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "4570",
      "source_id": "4570-14911-0012",
      "chapter": "14911",
      "transcript": "NECK MODERATELY LONG SLIGHTLY ARCHED THE THROAT SHOWING SOME DEWLAP",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "63104938c2f813b8588c67721690ae0654bd4df4f909ddb21e9ef9d5d3c593a8"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "6467",
      "source_id": "6467-94831-0040",
      "chapter": "94831",
      "transcript": "A DONKEY OH PELEG I DID NOTHING OF THE KIND",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "20ae9b0c073ba22a74d7bac30aee16841080e3c4e2e8490fdedd1d49e768fe29"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "6467",
      "source_id": "6467-94831-0034",
      "chapter": "94831",
      "transcript": "I DON'T SEE ANY PICTURE GROWLED SNUGGERS LOOKING AT THE SQUARE BLANKLY",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "20ae9b0c073ba22a74d7bac30aee16841080e3c4e2e8490fdedd1d49e768fe29"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "7601",
      "source_id": "7601-175351-0011",
      "chapter": "175351",
      "transcript": "A MURMUR WAS HEARD",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "e3b4627d1fadf2928f9d19b10588b3284fe4949d4a88270b1f0478e89104baee"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "7601",
      "source_id": "7601-175351-0007",
      "chapter": "175351",
      "transcript": "I DID SAID PEN ADVANCING TOWARDS THE CAPTAIN",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "e3b4627d1fadf2928f9d19b10588b3284fe4949d4a88270b1f0478e89104baee"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "1255",
      "source_id": "1255-90413-0000",
      "chapter": "90413",
      "transcript": "SHE DRAWS CLOSE AND SATISFIES",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "06589294b49cf28b976face9d03dcec32ed0aea61a0befe48f8320d699f23756"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "1255",
      "source_id": "1255-90407-0011",
      "chapter": "90407",
      "transcript": "I DON'T KNOW HE DOESN'T TELL ME MUCH OF HIS AFFAIRS",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "546fab0c8beb02dd2146264e8eac26f3b6f657baa712799ec67dd8246eeccf98"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "4323",
      "source_id": "4323-13259-0024",
      "chapter": "13259",
      "transcript": "THEN FOLLOWED WHAT WAS PERHAPS THE QUEER PART OF THIS STRANGE SERVICE",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "d4abb35f110ef8f8d27e8d623a9fc4bd222e27466c8e17c08ee709a7ce1f2fe9"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "4323",
      "source_id": "4323-55228-0050",
      "chapter": "55228",
      "transcript": "YES NODDED BILLY DEMURELY",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "c4c9ddbb20700d1e5926cf138cb6a92ebe3bb9671e8b8de53eb2389cee850217"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "8254",
      "source_id": "8254-84205-0026",
      "chapter": "84205",
      "transcript": "THAT'S RIGHT CRIED GRIGGS",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "dffc857ac6e0cc52306c0339fda8ca1c09f48e4672a0d964cd600a250df38bfb"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "8254",
      "source_id": "8254-115543-0026",
      "chapter": "115543",
      "transcript": "ISN'T IT FINE TO RIDE LIKE THAT ON A BIG ELEPHANT",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "23fc6a7b80d1d5df85e4f8f3268f0bc0aebb56c8f48cca4568e3e77ae46d6038"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "3660",
      "source_id": "3660-172182-0018",
      "chapter": "172182",
      "transcript": "TO GUENEVER AND HER HANDMAIDENS SAID HE",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "8b9d532bf0c94cf0d4096a6165136aecc3988be2832fd22eca784f0f5268aab0"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "3660",
      "source_id": "3660-172182-0010",
      "chapter": "172182",
      "transcript": "SO GUENEVER WENT TO THE GATE TO MEET HIM AND HE ENTERED",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "8b9d532bf0c94cf0d4096a6165136aecc3988be2832fd22eca784f0f5268aab0"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "1650",
      "source_id": "1650-173551-0002",
      "chapter": "173551",
      "transcript": "THE HALL PORTER WAS STANDING AT THE FRONT DOOR",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "10c885d3eae6c4458ab9959b798073761a4afe75dc91d936dce7b8648c5951c8"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "1650",
      "source_id": "1650-167613-0050",
      "chapter": "167613",
      "transcript": "GO BACK TO GORKI SAID PRINCE ANDREW SUDDENLY",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "bde61471d907bd9029baee82eb32b284b464a51d667d52c031e1becda352705b"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "1651",
      "source_id": "1651-136854-0021",
      "chapter": "136854",
      "transcript": "MAN AND WIFE HARDLY UNITED SCARCE EVER WITHOUT CHILDREN",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "5c1c51c88986ed27aa77059efcc33d0e85f6273ec22bfea578fe5fbb65b7365d"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "1651",
      "source_id": "1651-136854-0017",
      "chapter": "136854",
      "transcript": "SUPERIORITY PRODUCES INSOLENCE AND ENVY",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "5c1c51c88986ed27aa77059efcc33d0e85f6273ec22bfea578fe5fbb65b7365d"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "116",
      "source_id": "116-288047-0007",
      "chapter": "288047",
      "transcript": "THERE IS IN MAN A FACULTY FOR FICTION",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "4a61953853040d8d45e7080df1d098b54a9d93de6665d3efd4555283fbd8040b"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "116",
      "source_id": "116-288045-0010",
      "chapter": "288045",
      "transcript": "HE WAS AN IDOL THEN AND NOT A GOD",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "e1f3e5aee1a633968c72a7e1a6182f5d20be05c6257980f266325d2e1c70ffdb"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "700",
      "source_id": "700-122866-0002",
      "chapter": "122866",
      "transcript": "I SUPPOSE THAT IS WHY MARILLA DISAPPROVES OF THEM",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "7585cd9bd56e391dd20ea7868cd3d07c30029ad2b9b3302459dc625eb547f374"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "700",
      "source_id": "700-122868-0036",
      "chapter": "122868",
      "transcript": "EVERYTHING I DO GETS ME OR MY DEAREST FRIENDS INTO A SCRAPE",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "69274e8e0decf25edb6f90b01ba71850bf72232aa2c5efbab50240df1b440343"
    }
  ],
  "replication": [
    {
      "speaker": "4572",
      "source_id": "4572-112383-0001",
      "chapter": "112383",
      "transcript": "WHERE WHERE IS SITA",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "3d94b0f041e330b090dde73c4d88b9a720b0bc3a98de85a0507dd2012aab3119"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "4572",
      "source_id": "4572-112381-0002",
      "chapter": "112381",
      "transcript": "BUT HOW O PIOUS LADY SAY MAY WE THY GRACIOUS BOON REPAY",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "11218269abc0c210055f861230ee2a780014da8714ef69d9746140c1276d6cc3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "8288",
      "source_id": "8288-274162-0049",
      "chapter": "274162",
      "transcript": "IN WHOSE ROOM THEN",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "c22d076ad6cf48980e3c78119baf1332dcb257a6046a83b059db2fdfbd1267cc"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "8288",
      "source_id": "8288-274150-0005",
      "chapter": "274150",
      "transcript": "NO NO NOT TO DAY SIRE",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "23e887bb69873b2ae05413213b1d8bdb2c67d3d7c5dc3a9bf23b56c13558bc18"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "6841",
      "source_id": "6841-88294-0055",
      "chapter": "88294",
      "transcript": "WHY DON'T YOU GET YOUR TREASURE WITHOUT THE NEED OF DIVIDING IT",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "1d9d27b3c2dbbb741dfa298034e7c6a500e9cc4d0c7af1871e1b25bbaf609975"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "6841",
      "source_id": "6841-88294-0051",
      "chapter": "88294",
      "transcript": "HE DID SO NOW FIRE AWAY SAID I",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "1d9d27b3c2dbbb741dfa298034e7c6a500e9cc4d0c7af1871e1b25bbaf609975"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "1630",
      "source_id": "1630-73710-0010",
      "chapter": "73710",
      "transcript": "WRITE ONLY ONE WORD TO YOUR OWN HENRIETTA",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "a32b14a1429dc6133ee1c62e8d3baf0f76f49e1dcf2cf8692de559c2db91bd0b"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "1630",
      "source_id": "1630-141772-0007",
      "chapter": "141772",
      "transcript": "HE ASKED ON SEEING THE PRISONERS",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "3c451ffed417c6287692aa4f9b7f8824c9dc1df3378a23e616965be0de507406"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "1701",
      "source_id": "1701-141759-0013",
      "chapter": "141759",
      "transcript": "SONYA SMILED DO I REMEMBER NICHOLAS",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "97f1eb0d4033a0e9e99480daf5844782c2682a4a467991b29348a9b6dd45cdc3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "1701",
      "source_id": "1701-141760-0027",
      "chapter": "141760",
      "transcript": "IT IS SOME LETTER OF RECOMMENDATION WHAT THE DEVIL DO I WANT IT FOR",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "a3397a01e961785a4d10fa00231b6ded91d11684c6b1446867ca6a411f1ed35a"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "7697",
      "source_id": "7697-105815-0042",
      "chapter": "105815",
      "transcript": "THEN CHRISTIAN BENT DOWN HIS HEAD AND WENT WITH THEM TO THE HOUSE",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "a7b9b47b2b1bf7e9a3802fc36971fa9f31738a144c6d9bffd5847f778ee13f52"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "7697",
      "source_id": "7697-245712-0006",
      "chapter": "245712",
      "transcript": "THEREFORE THE SUBJECTION OF OTHER ANIMALS TO MAN IS PROVED TO BE NATURAL",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "9551ea3a274efc982246dee606a1fedaa82382f4a85e0139d1d4fa470e359821"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "4515",
      "source_id": "4515-11057-0010",
      "chapter": "11057",
      "transcript": "I HOPED YOU WOULD BRING ME SOME NEWS",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "bb77c88d9676df2ee41685a9e1fcf9ecc1409ec3221baa1ca405ffcfa50d715d"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "4515",
      "source_id": "4515-11057-0100",
      "chapter": "11057",
      "transcript": "THE RAIN FELL UNCEASINGLY AND WITH IT BEGAN TO MINGLE AN AUTUMNAL MIST",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "bb77c88d9676df2ee41685a9e1fcf9ecc1409ec3221baa1ca405ffcfa50d715d"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "4153",
      "source_id": "4153-186222-0024",
      "chapter": "186222",
      "transcript": "TO BE SURE I SHOULD WANT YOU TO MY DEAR",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "298aa031cc53fb1b35cede8086f4c9465780018cf48b00b711706fdff7f28a97"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "4153",
      "source_id": "4153-186223-0011",
      "chapter": "186223",
      "transcript": "YOU KNOW AUNT MISS MERRICK SIR",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "3eaa3babcced6f63dbf031a6b2e854ca8a78cfc35ccdffac8984fc8b049f28f9"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "3915",
      "source_id": "3915-57461-0009",
      "chapter": "57461",
      "transcript": "WHAT THINK YOU GENTLEMEN ADDED HE TURNING TO THE OTHER TRAVELLERS",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "fae73683be6f09b086a204c20505ebc716b74f1a3224732d4173cd74f1d7cd2d"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "3915",
      "source_id": "3915-57461-0022",
      "chapter": "57461",
      "transcript": "AND WOULD IT NOT ILL BECOME ME TO BEAR MALICE",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "fae73683be6f09b086a204c20505ebc716b74f1a3224732d4173cd74f1d7cd2d"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "6123",
      "source_id": "6123-59186-0010",
      "chapter": "59186",
      "transcript": "IS A LINE OF GOOD POETRY",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "36e1e45f5cdd5f15eea452604e5c4b5d9030c3319f27caa98078e31d66edccc1"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "6123",
      "source_id": "6123-59186-0003",
      "chapter": "59186",
      "transcript": "HE DOES NOT EXPRESS LIFE EASILY IN BEAUTIFUL WORDS OR IN IMAGES",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "36e1e45f5cdd5f15eea452604e5c4b5d9030c3319f27caa98078e31d66edccc1"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "3663",
      "source_id": "3663-172528-0013",
      "chapter": "172528",
      "transcript": "AFTERWARDS HE TURNED TO ME AND ASKED IF I COULD HAVE DRUNK MORE WATER",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "ef22c6b1f46a1f2b335865313e6ad206f5220d1cf141d33e3b1ebc3f6a9435fb"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "3663",
      "source_id": "3663-172528-0011",
      "chapter": "172528",
      "transcript": "SHE KNOWS WHAT SHE REQUIRES AND THE PHYSICIANS KNOW NOTHING",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "ef22c6b1f46a1f2b335865313e6ad206f5220d1cf141d33e3b1ebc3f6a9435fb"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "5543",
      "source_id": "5543-27761-0066",
      "chapter": "27761",
      "transcript": "IF THIS IS SO IS IT NOT A SIGN OF ORGANIC WEAKNESS",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "71994136dad5d3cfc62ad348e6365f91b147c52978fd05da3144d34d636e2d63"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "5543",
      "source_id": "5543-27761-0068",
      "chapter": "27761",
      "transcript": "SHE SUFFERED AS THOUGH COMMITTING AN EVIL DEED WITH FULL CONSCIOUSNESS",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "71994136dad5d3cfc62ad348e6365f91b147c52978fd05da3144d34d636e2d63"
    }
  ]
}
